     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:15px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:22px;background-color:rgb(251,251,251)\">The Twitter Bootstrap allows for many class styles for buttons. <br><a href=\"http://getbootstrap.com/2.3.2/base-css.html#buttons\" style=\"color:rgb(65,131,196)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://getbootstrap.com/2.3.2/base-css.html%23buttons&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406576592000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mEc6iT92wfNr19himSNds\">http://getbootstrap.com/2.3.2/base-css.html#buttons</a></p><p style=\"margin-top:15px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;line-height:22px;background-color:rgb(251,251,251);margin-bottom:0px!important\"><br></p></div><div>actionButton &lt;- function(inputId, label, style = &quot;&quot; , additionalClass = &quot;&quot;) {</div><div>  if (style %in% c(&quot;primary&quot;,&quot;info&quot;,&quot;success&quot;,&quot;warning&quot;,&quot;danger&quot;,&quot;inverse&quot;,&quot;link&quot;)) {</div><div>    class.style &lt;- paste(&quot;btn&quot;,style,sep=&quot;-&quot;)</div><div>  } else class.style = &quot;&quot;</div><div>  </div><div>  tags$button(id=inputId, type=&quot;button&quot;, class=paste(&quot;btn action-button&quot;,class.style,additionalClass), label)</div><div>}</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>You can paste the above code after your library(shiny) code to enable more styling for your actionButton.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CKGV3UPwYLc/Ul7hzf4fcEI/AAAAAAAADg4/RXtcefTYvto/s1600/actionButton+Styling.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CKGV3UPwYLc/Ul7hzf4fcEI/AAAAAAAADg4/RXtcefTYvto/s1600/actionButton%2BStyling.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406576592000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lY2J_6t09sLTP4NJnDjc0\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CKGV3UPwYLc/Ul7hzf4fcEI/AAAAAAAADg4/RXtcefTYvto/s1600/actionButton+Styling.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/7012930\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/7012930&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406576592000&amp;usg=AOvVaw364CkpJjJP-y5xh9Hnr-h0\">https://gist.github.com/xiaodaigh/7012930</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>shiny::runGist(&quot;7012930&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>I have done a pull request of the above code. Hopefully it will get incorporate into Shiny proper in the next version</div></div>"
